
Fact prim Identified by A, B

Fact bin Identified by prim * prim'

Fact level Identified by bin * prim.

+level.

?level(bin(A, A), A).
?level(bin(A, A), B).
?level(bin(A, B), A).
?level(bin(B, A), A).

?(Forall prim1, prim2, prim3 : level(bin(prim1, prim2), prim3)).

Fact single Identified by bin
  Holds when (bin.prim == bin.prim').

?!(Forall prim1, prim2: single(bin(prim1, prim2))).
?(Forall prim: single(bin(prim, prim))).
